Starting 1 April, employees who wish to park in the company lot will need a permit. Permits will be {{1}} free of charge and can be requested through the intranet.

Because the number of spaces is limited, priority will be given to employees who live more than 15 km from the office {{2}} have reduced mobility. {{3}}

We encourage everyone else to use public transportation or the company's bicycle-{{4}} program.
